🇷🇺🔹 The Russian Ministry of Defense announced that the Russian Armed Forces have launched a series of strikes against logistics centers, naval vessels, port infrastructure, and energy facilities in Ukraine.

During the night of September 4th, high-precision weapons and attack drones were used to target:

➡️A logistics center in the village of Gatnoye in the Kiev region, where dual-use goods were stored and distributed;

➡️A cargo ship carrying military products in the port of "Yuzhny";

➡️In the port of "Chornomorsk," a cargo ship carrying Western-made weapons, a warehouse with military equipment, and a fuel terminal intended for the Ukrainian Armed Forces;

➡️An electrical substation called "Novoodesskaya" in the village of Mirny.

